title: "Reinforcement Learning: A First Look"
abstract: >-
  A companion extra to Supply Chain AI in Python, written for
  scmaiteaching.org; it is not part of the book. A Jupyter notebook with
  two small reinforcement-learning experiments: three slot machines, and a
  robot in a grid. The MIT License covers the notebook's code cells only,
  not its explanatory text.
